patch type="fixed" "Region URLs returned by region discovery are now validated before the SDK fails over to them. Only encrypted (`wss`/`https`) LiveKit Cloud URLs are accepted, and the check is applied to both sources of a region list: the `/settings/regions` response and the regions the server reports over signalling. `isCloudUrl` also now matches the Cloud domains on the host suffix rather than with `contains`, so a host such as `project.livekit.cloud.example.com` is no longer treated as LiveKit Cloud"
